' The Syncthing conflict resolver, TermForms' acceptance program: finds
' Syncthing's *.sync-conflict-* copies in the folders its config.xml
' lists and keeps the version chosen, the other moved to a dated folder
' outside the synced ones.
'
' Build and run:   tfc syncfix.vbp && ./syncfix [--config FILE] [--removed FOLDER] [FOLDER...]
Name=syncfix
Startup=frmMain
Form=main.bas
Module=conflicts.bas
